{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1550536-1e-aquatic-cabal-the-sons-of-j\u00f6rmungandr-\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f\u26c8\ufe0f","id":1550536,"title":"[1e Aquatic Cabal] The Sons of J\u00f6rmungandr \ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f\u26c8\ufe0f","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-01T05:18:38-07:00","id":1550536,"title":"[1e Aquatic Cabal] The Sons of J\u00f6rmungandr \ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f\u26c8\ufe0f","content":"While I was brainstorming Awakened antagonists for <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a>, I came up with an idea for a mad Storm Keeper, a kind of modern Captain Ahab whose &quot;white whale&quot; is globalized society itself. Originally he was going to operate solo, but it quickly became clear to me that such a madman would inevitably make a TON of enemies both mortal and supernatural, and that even the toughest and most competent sea captain would be hard-pressed to pilot any vessel that was big enough not to be swamped by his own storms. So the idea expanded into an entire cabal, a collection of sailors and seamen and scientists who have all despaired of ever being able to stop or even minimize climate change... so they've decided to go the opposite route, and use global warming to destroy global warming.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zl6Ob8dgRVVGbvqUkZ8aaNbPCZVqEIQaxPQHEN38erM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zl6Ob8dgRVVGbvqUkZ8aaNbPCZVqEIQaxPQHEN38erM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zl6Ob8dgRVVGbvqUkZ8aaNbPCZVqEIQaxPQHEN38erM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zl6Ob8dgRVVGbvqUkZ8aaNbPCZVqEIQaxPQHEN38erM/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> *No relation to the genestealer cult of the same name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":6327,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","user":"Super_Dave","date":". 08-01-2025, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-01T06:44:20-07:00","id":1550537,"title":"","content":"I feel like they need a stronger supernatural component. Mages are addicted to Mysteries, and there isn't one driving him. Simplifying the creation of Purified to make humans more in tune with nature's spirit, hunting a giant whale shaped Atlantean ruin for lost terraforming secrets, trafficking with akathartoi for ways to corrupt the spirit ecology into one that serves their goals, salvaging pieces of GM Infrastructure to build their own, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-01T07:26:28-07:00","id":1550538,"title":"","content":"I feel as though your intention was not to have the entire Awakened crew be Mad with the attendant mechanical stipulations, so it may be prudent to set their Wisdom ratings to something other than 0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-02T03:44:15-07:00","id":1550571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1550536-1e-aquatic-cabal-the-sons-of-j\u00f6rmungandr-\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f\u26c8\ufe0f?p=1550537#post1550537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like they need a stronger supernatural component. Mages are addicted to Mysteries, and there isn't one driving him. Simplifying the creation of Purified to make humans more in tune with nature's spirit, hunting a giant whale shaped Atlantean ruin for lost terraforming secrets, trafficking with akathartoi for ways to corrupt the spirit ecology into one that serves their goals, salvaging pieces of GM Infrastructure to build their own, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Although I love your ideas and would personally play the hell out of them, I'm not sure I'm up enough on mage lore to attempt to write something like that on my own. I'm satisfied enough with the current shape and orientation of the cabal that I don't think I want to fundamentally change their raison d'etre at this point. Though I am writing down your whale-shaped rune idea for further consideration.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1550536-1e-aquatic-cabal-the-sons-of-j\u00f6rmungandr-\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f\u26c8\ufe0f?p=1550538#post1550538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel as though your intention was not to have the entire Awakened crew be Mad with the attendant mechanical stipulations, so it may be prudent to set their Wisdom ratings to something other than 0.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit it's not ideal from a mechanics standpoint, but the fact is the Wisdom table specifically calls out mass murder as a level-one transgression, and they're committing... if not murder, then at least premeditated manslaughter on a massive scale. I suppose some of them could be hanging onto their last point of Wisdom by virtue of the fact that they're doing it to save more lives (or at least make a future with any lives in it).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hFPB1g/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Seas</a><br /> <b>Current Project(s)</b>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15v9c9IWq_HOjZoYPWqceTxQ0-z1epdN4pt5F6nMUYpE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">We Have Fought the Long Defeat</a>, a Late Antiquity/Early Medieval Dark Era for <i>Genius: The Transgression</i>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/12IQd13VQ0kHFY19yUBBkqVA-cKT0gZlByOkgYRkb-Ss/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Just Before the Dawn</i></a><i>,</i> a 1970s PtH Dark Era","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6327-super_dave","name":"Super_Dave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}